  "headline": "Indonesian Police Investigate Alleged Wiretapping Of President Prabowo",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesian Police Investigate Wiretap Case",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian National Police are investigating allegations that former police chief Listyo Sigit and other generals conducted illegal wiretapping.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto stated that former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and three other generals allegedly ordered the illegal wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto.",
    "A high-ranking active officer identified by the initials TK is currently being questioned by the internal affairs division regarding his involvement.",
    "Authorities have conducted searches of properties linked to the accused, and the witness protection agency is evaluating potential whistleblower support."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are investigating a major scandal involving allegations of unauthorized surveillance against President Prabowo Subianto. According to testimonies provided by current National Police Chief Suyudi Ario Seto during a parliamentary hearing, the operation was allegedly orchestrated by his predecessor, Listyo Sigit, alongside three other high-ranking police generals. Reports indicate that these officials reportedly issued verbal orders to facilitate the illegal monitoring activities. The investigation has expanded to include an active brigadier general identified by the initials TK, who is currently undergoing interrogation by the police's professional and security division. Law enforcement has also executed search warrants at residences associated with the implicated former police leadership. As the investigation progresses, the Witness and Victim Protection Agency has expressed a willingness to offer protection to individuals who come forward as justice collaborators to assist with the ongoing inquiry into the unauthorized wiretapping.",
